{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/steam_page_gameplay_preview.gif?t=1752972122\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a land inspired by Korean folklore, summon cloud companions and fight the hordes of monsters. Collect coins and make offerings in exchange for more clouds and relics to upgrade your cloud army. Fulfill your duty as Cloud Keeper to the moon goddess Dal and stop the spread of destruction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play and unlock multiple unique characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock dozens of characters to play as the Cloud Keeper, each with different abilities to make every run a unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.poster.avif?t=1752972122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.webm?t=1752972122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.mp4?t=1752972122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summon clouds and collect relics to make them stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit and build an army of clouds to fight for you! Fuse 3 clouds of the same type into a stronger form! Make offerings in exchange for relics to upgrade your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/2a1f884e6be8e9a122f279b81c42332d.poster.avif?t=1752972122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st